{"title": "Psionic Revenge", "pageid": 28341, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Revenge", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Psionic Revenge</b> is a passive feature that retaliates against an enemy that made the wearer make a saving throw.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, the foe that caused the throw takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> also gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge\" title=\"Circlet of Psionic Revenge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Psionic_Revenge\" title=\"Circlet of Psionic Revenge\">Circlet of Psionic Revenge</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">W'wargaz</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When Psionic Revenge fires, the wearer is not considered the source of damage. This means it does not break <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a>, but also does not trigger features from items, like the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Gloves\" title=\"Braindrain Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Gloves\" title=\"Braindrain Gloves\">Braindrain Gloves</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When you succeed a saving throw, the foe that caused it takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4 Psychic</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1898/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16927/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6948/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968731/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.625      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   53.625      1 -total\n 23.95%   12.846     25 Template:Trim\n 22.66%   12.154      3 Template:Ico